translate chinese venice_tavern_circus_4f90c58d:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}在酒馆消磨时光时，你偶然结识了一个杂耍班子的班主——他们即将在不久后的节日上登台献艺。"

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:1430
translate chinese venice_tavern_circus_f2543d74:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}可这位谈话对象非但没有为赚钱的前景而欣喜，反倒愁云满面。"

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:1432
translate chinese venice_tavern_circus_a91992f7:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你问起缘由，他说是对头班子的同行在艺人们吃食里动了手脚，结果手下的人已经连着两天离不开茅房了。"

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:1434
translate chinese venice_tavern_circus_8c1c3a33:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}若这场病几小时内仍不见好，整场演出——连同赚钱的希望——就都要泡汤了。"

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:1438
translate chinese venice_tavern_circus_7d581dd2:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你答应帮忙。"

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:1440
translate chinese venice_tavern_circus_9dcd6abb:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}{color=#A9A9A9}接受新任务——[universal_remedy.name!ti]。"

