# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:15403
translate chinese venice_bodyguard_chapter_5_end_989d364d:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你混进一大群决定追随总督人马攻打基奥贾的志愿者中，傍晚时分抵达了兵工厂——那里已经开始往桨帆船上装载物资。"

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:15405
translate chinese venice_bodyguard_chapter_5_end_51417319:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}登上船后，你与其余市民一起站到一名军官面前，听他布置接下来的任务与打法。"

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:15407
translate chinese venice_bodyguard_chapter_5_end_c855ad21:

    nvl clear
    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}可你根本没有听进去，只是望着远方。"

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:15411
translate chinese venice_bodyguard_chapter_5_end_8cccf7a7:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}望着暮色中、地平线尽头依稀闪烁的基奥贾灯火。"

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:15413
translate chinese venice_bodyguard_chapter_5_end_8ed2febd:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}就在那里——穿过泻湖的黑色深渊与陡峭的岸崖，越过獠牙般布满火炮与弩炮的堡垒，再穿过街巷交错、路障重重、雇佣兵武装到牙齿的城市迷宫——就在这条你不得不走完的地狱之路的尽头，正如冰封于地狱中心的恶魔般，卡洛·因佩里亚利正在等着你。"

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:15415
translate chinese venice_bodyguard_chapter_5_end_0131e888:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}与他一同等着你的，还有弗朗切斯卡——卡瓦利家最后的遗存。"

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:15417
translate chinese venice_bodyguard_chapter_5_end_894b0066:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}日落时分，船队驶离威尼斯，朝着地平线上基奥贾的灯火进发。"

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:15419
translate chinese venice_bodyguard_chapter_5_end_76b2fe88:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:15425
translate chinese venice_bodyguard_chapter_5_end_e87c5660:

    "{cps=50}舰队逼近城防工事时，威尼斯桨帆船遭到了投石机和数门小口径火炮的轰击。"

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:15427
translate chinese venice_bodyguard_chapter_5_end_7e9c3282:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}几发敌弹也砸中了你们的船，造成重创。"

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:15429
translate chinese venice_bodyguard_chapter_5_end_5d7e55ad:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}起初船似乎还能勉强浮着，可它很快便失去操控，开始倾侧。"

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:15431
translate chinese venice_bodyguard_chapter_5_end_539f6fc6:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}还没等桨帆船沉没，水手和士兵们便纷纷跳入水中。"

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:15433
translate chinese venice_bodyguard_chapter_5_end_5a113283:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你也别无选择，只能照做。"

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:15435
translate chinese venice_bodyguard_chapter_5_end_76b2fe88_1:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:15468
translate chinese venice_bodyguard_chapter_5_end_579a640d:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}{color=#A9A9A9}轻装——失败！"

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:15470
translate chinese venice_bodyguard_chapter_5_end_9ae3f050:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}一落水你便明白：凭这身装备的分量，你在水面上撑不了多久。"

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:15474
translate chinese venice_bodyguard_chapter_5_end_d8fe6cbb:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}许多落水者纷纷卸下装备以免沉底——可你却反其道而行，死死抱着武器与盔甲，硬要带着它们浮在水上。"

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:15476
translate chinese venice_bodyguard_chapter_5_end_de8b6edc:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}这让你费尽了力气，还灌了好几口水。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}疲劳值上升！{vspace=5}生命力 -5！"

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:15480
translate chinese venice_bodyguard_chapter_5_end_e69a1d96:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}幸而，旁边一艘桨帆船的船员及时发现你，把你拉了上去。"

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:15483
translate chinese venice_bodyguard_chapter_5_end_27c85a7f:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你卸下最沉重的装备，顺利游到一艘邻近的桨帆船旁，船上的船员把落水者都拉了上来。"

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:15485
translate chinese venice_bodyguard_chapter_5_end_76b2fe88_3:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:15488
translate chinese venice_bodyguard_chapter_5_end_fbb6292c:

    "{cps=50}{color=#A9A9A9}盾牌遗失！"

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:15489
translate chinese venice_bodyguard_chapter_5_end_76b2fe88_2:

    nvl clear
    ""

