    ""

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:15662
translate chinese venice_bodyguard_chapter_5_end_9e323653:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}{color=#A9A9A9}轻装——成功！"

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:15664
translate chinese venice_bodyguard_chapter_5_end_750e070b:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}许多落水者都卸下装备以免沉底——不过你的武器和护甲轻便，压根不用这么麻烦。"

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:15666
translate chinese venice_bodyguard_chapter_5_end_297f7606:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你顺利游到一艘邻近的桨帆船旁，船上的船员把落水者都拉了上来。"

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:15669
translate chinese venice_bodyguard_chapter_5_end_656ee2ff:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}当桨帆船贴近一座守卫城市的堡垒时，甲板上在军官的一声令下支起几架梯子，架到了城墙上。"

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:15671
translate chinese venice_bodyguard_chapter_5_end_ed8ed0ea:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}最先冲上去的勇士们已经攀上了墙头。"

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:15673
translate chinese venice_bodyguard_chapter_5_end_7448e292:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你是最早登上城墙的人之一，与堡垒的守军交上了手。"

