# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:16665
translate chinese francesca_chioggia_assault_2_postfight_66dec7a5:

    "{cps=50}拱卫基奥贾的堡垒相继陷落，通往城内的路敞开了——不久，威尼斯人的第一批队伍便冲上了街头。"

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:16666
translate chinese francesca_chioggia_assault_2_postfight_1aba3485:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}在圣多明尼克教堂一带，你们的队伍迎面撞上一大群赶来增援城防的热那亚雇佣兵。"

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:16671
translate chinese francesca_chioggia_assault_2_postfight_76b2fe88_1:

