# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:20214
translate chinese end_of_cambrai_multipath_decider_6b509347:

    "{cps=50}旅途拖了两个多月，路上你的几位同伴先后染上重病，唯独你安然无恙。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}生命力、耐力——判定成功！"

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:20216
translate chinese end_of_cambrai_multipath_decider_f04de715:

    "{cps=50}旅途拖了两个多月，途中你得了一场重病。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}生命力、耐力——判定失败！{vspace=5}所有属性降低2点！"

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:20228
translate chinese end_of_cambrai_multipath_decider_76b2fe88_5:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:20234
translate chinese end_of_cambrai_multipath_decider_979f771c:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}抵达威尼斯后，你被此地的风光深深打动，然而在这座水上之城驻足长留的缘分，似乎与你无缘。"

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:20236
translate chinese end_of_cambrai_multipath_decider_d6586f69:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你与众多来自欧洲各地的雇佣兵队长一同觐见威尼斯总督安德烈亚·孔塔里尼，签订为期一年的正式服役契约；不久之后，你被派驻到威尼斯北面的特雷维索城一带。"

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:20238
translate chinese end_of_cambrai_multipath_decider_f85a2258:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}接到的命令指示：因你的队伍人数太少，须并入罗兰多·德·罗西统率的大队，出任他的副手。"

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:20240
translate chinese end_of_cambrai_multipath_decider_de7e5999:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}此后你的职责便是“维持秩序”与“保持部队战斗力”。至于未来的出征或战役，文书中只字未提。"

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:20242
translate chinese end_of_cambrai_multipath_decider_6cf25156:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}对冒险、危险与丰厚战利品的期待，就这样被驻防日常的乏味现实撞得粉碎。"

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:20244
translate chinese end_of_cambrai_multipath_decider_76b2fe88_6:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:20367
translate chinese venice_doge_intro_93c5579b:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}总督下达的指示要求你向罗兰多·德·罗西报到。"

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:20369
translate chinese venice_doge_intro_73af2f7f:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}置身于大群陌生面孔之中，你不得不重新在袍泽之间挣得声名。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}声望（士兵）降低80！"

