# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:20485
translate chinese treviso_camp_fight_11f34af4:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}一天中午用餐时，你目睹两拨士兵起了冲突——他们之间不知为了什么闹翻了脸。"

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:20487
translate chinese treviso_camp_fight_f78ea681:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}起初只是小小的口角，转眼间愈演愈烈，眼看就要酿成一场白刃相见的群殴。"

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:20491
translate chinese treviso_camp_fight_76b2fe88:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:20494
translate chinese treviso_camp_fight_107bcc36:

    "{cps=50}你认为尽快恢复军纪比追究是非对错更为紧要，便无暇细查，当即逮住几个最先映入眼帘的参与者，从重惩处，迅速平息了冲突。"

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:20495
translate chinese treviso_camp_fight_fb8355d5:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}{color=#A9A9A9}声望（士兵）降低[attackchance!i]点。{vspace=5}虔诚降低[attackchance2!i]点。"

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:20500
translate chinese treviso_camp_fight_76b2fe88_1:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:20503
translate chinese treviso_camp_fight_39ffc4e1:

    "{cps=50}你平息冲突后，展开了详尽的调查，公正地惩处了主要肇事者，对余下众人则予以警告。"

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:20504
translate chinese treviso_camp_fight_d3923c68:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}{color=#A9A9A9}声望（士兵）提升[attackchance!i]点。{vspace=5}耗去时间：[attackchance2!i]。"

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:20509
