    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:20515
translate chinese treviso_camp_blacksmith_e38294cd:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}特雷维索的铁匠向你告状：昨夜有人趁黑洗劫了他的作坊，偷走了大量武器与装备——盗贼正是你手下的士兵。"

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:20517
translate chinese treviso_camp_blacksmith_8e1cd1d9:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}他要求严惩罪犯，并归还失窃之物。"

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:20519
translate chinese treviso_camp_blacksmith_1ae9fa7c:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你略作调查，轻而易举便查出了元凶。"

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:20521
translate chinese treviso_camp_blacksmith_8f782bba:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}他们辩解说：那铁匠把货物卖得奇贵，早已富得流油——真遇上危难，还能躲进城墙里安然无恙。"

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:20523
translate chinese treviso_camp_blacksmith_91c2d1cc:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}可要保卫这些城墙、乃至城外通道的，恰恰是他们自己。"

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:20525
translate chinese treviso_camp_blacksmith_c7c6f9b2:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}照他们看，在这种情形下分他一些装备，实在是再公道不过。"

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:20528
translate chinese treviso_camp_blacksmith_9762072c:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}听着这番说辞，你总觉得这故事似曾相识……或许你甚至亲历其中。"

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:20532
translate chinese treviso_camp_blacksmith_76b2fe88:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:20535
translate chinese treviso_camp_blacksmith_f29181d5:

    "{cps=50}你应铁匠所求，惩处了罪犯，并将失物如数归还。"

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:20536
translate chinese treviso_camp_blacksmith_553daf5f:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}{color=#A9A9A9}声望（士兵）降低[attackchance!i]点。{vspace=5}虔诚提升[attackchance2!i]点。"

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:20540
translate chinese treviso_camp_blacksmith_169148fd:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}{color=#A9A9A9}与铁匠的关系改善了。"

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:20544
translate chinese treviso_camp_blacksmith_76b2fe88_1:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:20547
translate chinese treviso_camp_blacksmith_8a84cecf:

    "{cps=50}你认为士兵们情有可原，便对这次越轨之举睁一只眼闭一只眼。"

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:20548
translate chinese treviso_camp_blacksmith_be08a78c:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}{color=#A9A9A9}声望（士兵）提升[attackchance!i]点。{vspace=5}虔诚降低[attackchance2!i]点。{vspace=5}德·罗西部队的装备质量提升。"

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:20553
translate chinese treviso_camp_blacksmith_8a05db6a:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}{color=#A9A9A9}与铁匠的关系恶化了。"

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:20557
translate chinese treviso_camp_blacksmith_76b2fe88_2:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:20563
translate chinese treviso_camp_rations_bfc30b91:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}特雷维索市长指定为营地供粮的一处农场失火，德·罗西的人马被迫忍受极其匮乏的伙食，士气大受打击。"

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:20565
translate chinese treviso_camp_rations_6460d7c3:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}市长答应解决此事，但说需要一些时日。"

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:20567
translate chinese treviso_camp_rations_eea7cca3:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}与此同时，士兵们纷纷要求你保证他们的正常饮食。"

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:20572
translate chinese treviso_camp_rations_menu_76b2fe88_1:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:20576
translate chinese treviso_camp_rations_menu_f9d874b9:

    "{cps=50}你自掏腰包，为队伍购办了口粮。"

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:20577
translate chinese treviso_camp_rations_menu_b5176fdc:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}{color=#A9A9A9}声望（士兵）提升[attackchance!i]点。{vspace=5}失去[attackchance2!i]弗罗林。"

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:20582
translate chinese treviso_camp_rations_menu_94547691:

    "{cps=50}{color=#A9A9A9}钱不够！"

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:20583
translate chinese treviso_camp_rations_menu_76b2fe88:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:20589
translate chinese treviso_camp_rations_menu_60065481:

    "{cps=50}你允许士兵们自行在城郊搜罗、征用所需的口粮。"

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:20590
translate chinese treviso_camp_rations_menu_2afde21c:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}{color=#A9A9A9}声望（士兵）提升[attackchance!i]点。{vspace=5}虔诚降低[attackchance2!i]点。"

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:20594
translate chinese treviso_camp_rations_menu_dc30cf89:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}特雷维索市长对这种越权行径大为恼火，下令禁止德·罗西的士兵进入城中的澡堂与妓院等公共场所。"

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:20602
translate chinese treviso_camp_rations_menu_76b2fe88_2:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:20608
translate chinese treviso_camp_gamble_517b0a41:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你撞见一大群士兵正在掷骰子。赌注不菲，其中一位输家——一个巴伐利亚壮汉——已指责对手出千，两人都伸手摸向匕首。"

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:20610
translate chinese treviso_camp_gamble_ef51d751:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}紧张的气氛一触即发，随时可能化作一场血腥斗殴。"

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:20614
translate chinese treviso_camp_gamble_76b2fe88:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:20617
translate chinese treviso_camp_gamble_d426de7f:

    "{cps=50}身为指挥官，你当即介入，喝停赌局，没收全部赌注。"

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:20618
translate chinese treviso_camp_gamble_c69033c6:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}士兵们对这一举动自然满腹怨气，不过军纪总算是保住了——只是此举并不能为你赢得人心。"

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:20620
translate chinese treviso_camp_gamble_f9c56e02:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}{color=#A9A9A9}声望（士兵）降低[attackchance2!i]点。{vspace=5}获得[attackchance!i]弗罗林。"

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:20626
translate chinese treviso_camp_gamble_76b2fe88_1:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:20629
translate chinese treviso_camp_gamble_e149f5aa:

    "{cps=50}为了缓和气氛，你抛给巴伐利亚人几枚钱币，怂恿他再赌一把翻本，自己也加入了赌局。"

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:20630
translate chinese treviso_camp_gamble_0f0ecc9f:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}这招奏效了——冲突被按下不提。漫长的赌局结束时，赢家竟是连队里出了名倒霉的理发师，简直是个奇迹，众人皆大欢喜。"

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:20632
translate chinese treviso_camp_gamble_b5176fdc:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}{color=#A9A9A9}声望（士兵）提升[attackchance!i]点。{vspace=5}失去[attackchance2!i]弗罗林。"

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:20637
translate chinese treviso_camp_gamble_76b2fe88_2:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:20643
translate chinese treviso_camp_monk_afa30751:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}一日清晨，一名云游的方济各会修士来到营地，想在雇佣兵们中间布几场道。"

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:20645
translate chinese treviso_camp_monk_a8342a1e:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}他称你手下的人是“深陷罪孽行当的迷途之魂”，恳切地请求能与他们交谈，劝其中哪怕几个人从残暴与暴力的歧路上回头。"

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:20649
translate chinese treviso_camp_monk_76b2fe88:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:20652
translate chinese treviso_camp_monk_d7d601a6:

    "{cps=50}你唯恐士气被瓦解，便将这修士赶了出去。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}虔诚降低[attackchance]点！"

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:20657
translate chinese treviso_camp_monk_a02e25ac:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你准许修士布道。"

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:20659
translate chinese treviso_camp_monk_b59b5f73:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}士兵们阴沉着脸，却听得入神。布道结束时，一些人开始公开质疑自己的营生，甚至盘算着另谋出路。"

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:20661
translate chinese treviso_camp_monk_76b2fe88_1:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:20668
translate chinese treviso_camp_monk_53712ddd:

    "{cps=50}{color=#A9A9A9}德·罗西部队的训练质量降低[attackchance]点！{vspace=5}虔诚提升[attackchance2!i]点！"

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:20669
translate chinese treviso_camp_monk_269dfbdf:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}修士为布道之机向你道谢，并邀请你造访圣玛利亚诺瓦修道院——他的修会在特雷维索的驻地。"

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:20672
translate chinese treviso_camp_monk_76b2fe88_2:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:20678
translate chinese treviso_camp_deserters_c4857197:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}军士来报：三名托斯卡纳新兵不见了，随他们一起消失的还有三张弩、一袋干粮和几套护甲。从足迹看，他们是朝家乡方向去了。"

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:20682
translate chinese treviso_camp_deserters_726ca22c:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你当即组织追捕，派出一队骑兵循迹而去。"

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:20684
translate chinese treviso_camp_deserters_76b2fe88:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:20689
translate chinese treviso_camp_deserters_2a415d00:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}骑兵们毫不费力地追上了逃兵，日落时分，已押着俘虏回到营中。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}幸运——判定成功！"

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:20693
translate chinese treviso_camp_deserters_b7b80e9b:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}然而骑兵中没有一个老练的追踪能手，追捕无功而返，日落时你的人两手空空地归来。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}幸运——判定失败！"

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:20699
translate chinese treviso_camp_deserters_826ec01c:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你即刻组织追捕，并亲自率领一队骑兵循迹而去。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}耗去时间：[attackchance]"

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:20701
translate chinese treviso_camp_deserters_76b2fe88_1:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:20703
translate chinese treviso_camp_deserters_a4e8fcfa:

    "{cps=50}身为经验丰富的追踪者，你不费吹灰之力便寻到逃兵，很快将他们一网成擒。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}森林造访次数、民事天赋——判定成功！"

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:20706
translate chinese treviso_camp_deserters_890b916e:

    "{cps=50}然而你的追踪本领尚有欠缺，没过多久便跟丢了。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}森林造访次数、民事天赋——判定失败！"

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:20707
translate chinese treviso_camp_deserters_acfb0e54:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}又徒劳搜寻了一阵，你两手空空地回到营地。"

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:20718
translate chinese treviso_camp_deserters_56476f74:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你决定不为几个逃兵耗费时间与精力，这对营中纪律产生了恶劣影响。"

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:20720
translate chinese treviso_camp_deserters_a3fe7159:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}{color=#A9A9A9}德·罗西部队的训练质量降低[attackchance]点！{vspace=5}德·罗西部队的装备质量降低！{vspace=5}声望（士兵）降低[attackchance2!i]点！"

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:20722
translate chinese treviso_camp_deserters_76b2fe88_2:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:20724
translate chinese treviso_camp_deserters_76b2fe88_3:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:20732
translate chinese treviso_camp_deserters_fail_064e0ae7:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}{color=#A9A9A9}德·罗西部队的装备质量降低！{vspace=5}声望（士兵）降低[attackchance2!i]点！"

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:20734
translate chinese treviso_camp_deserters_fail_76b2fe88:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:20738
translate chinese treviso_camp_deserters_success_2fe3e35e:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你将逃兵交到德·罗西手上，由他处置他们的命运。"

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:20743
translate chinese treviso_camp_deserters_success_35d5d28f:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}{color=#A9A9A9}声望（士兵）提升[attackchance2!i]点！"

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:20745
translate chinese treviso_camp_deserters_success_76b2fe88:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:20753
translate chinese santa_maria_nova_visit_62c1c715:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你造访了圣玛利亚诺瓦修道院……"

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:20755
translate chinese santa_maria_nova_visit_76b2fe88:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:20757
translate chinese santa_maria_nova_visit_954ddd71:

    "{cps=50}然而像你这样的无信之徒，在这里怕是难寻容身之处，也难有差事可做……"

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:20760
translate chinese santa_maria_nova_visit_menu_76b2fe88:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:20764
translate chinese santa_maria_nova_visit_menu_af96c3c6:

    "{cps=50}你花了一整天祈祷……{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}耗去时间：1"

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:20771
translate chinese santa_maria_nova_visit_menu_a3d91ca0:

    "{cps=50}收下你郑重许下的誓言——只为行善才动刀兵——以及一笔微薄的酬金后，修士们为你的武器祝福。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}失去[price_of_blessing_weapon]弗罗林！{vspace=5}武器已获祝福！"

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:20772
translate chinese santa_maria_nova_visit_menu_76b2fe88_1:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:20776
translate chinese santa_maria_nova_visit_menu_d102d9e6:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}{color=#A9A9A9}钱不够！"

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:20778
translate chinese santa_maria_nova_visit_menu_76b2fe88_2:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:20783
translate chinese santa_maria_nova_visit_menu_76b2fe88_3:

    nvl clear
