# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:22967
translate chinese silver_falcon_1_postfight_5b34127a:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}料理完敌人，你终于得空环顾四周——映入眼帘的景象可不怎么令人愉快。"

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:22969
translate chinese silver_falcon_1_postfight_2fd1782d:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}“银鹰客栈”里来了一大队武装到牙齿的凶徒，他们闯进各个房间，殴打、劫掠宾客，无论金子首饰，还是烛台雕花餐具，凡是值钱的都毫无廉耻地据为己有。"

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:22971
translate chinese silver_falcon_1_postfight_83ffc4d3:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}在此久留十分危险，可德·罗西仍在客栈深处的某个地方。"

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:22973
translate chinese silver_falcon_1_postfight_76b2fe88_1:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:22978
translate chinese silver_falcon_event_decider_76b2fe88:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:22984
translate chinese silver_falcon_event_decider_d8289d12:

    "{cps=50}最近的拐角处又冒出一伙强盗……"

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:22989
translate chinese silver_falcon_event_decider_76b2fe88_1:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:23000
translate chinese silver_falcon_hub_76b2fe88:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:23002
translate chinese silver_falcon_hub_831ab085:

    "{cps=50}袭击来得太过突然，你决定在动身寻找德·罗西之前，先弄清周围的状况。"

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:23003
translate chinese silver_falcon_hub_76b2fe88_1:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:23009
translate chinese silver_falcon_hub_loot_menu_64038d60:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你沿“银鹰客栈”的走廊前行，朝一扇敞开的门里张望，发现是某位客人匆忙间弃下的房间，满地散落着还未来得及被强盗染指的财物。"

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:23011
translate chinese silver_falcon_hub_loot_menu_9645fa1f:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}对他们来说不走运的是，先到此处的人是你——这意味着只有一件事。"

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:23013
translate chinese silver_falcon_hub_loot_menu_f559c638:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}好东西绝不能都便宜了那些匪徒。"

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:23016
translate chinese silver_falcon_hub_loot_menu_76b2fe88:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:23022
translate chinese silver_falcon_hub_loot_menu_c064c60c:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你沿走廊前行，来到“银鹰客栈”的主厅。"

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:23024
translate chinese silver_falcon_hub_loot_menu_ac52bfe0:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}这里不久前还以富丽堂皇令人赞叹，如今却被洗劫一空，宾客们残破的尸首散落各处，景象令人窒息。"

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:23026
translate chinese silver_falcon_hub_loot_menu_2269d191:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}然而在这片混乱与狼藉之中，显然仍有不少可图之物。"

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:23028
translate chinese silver_falcon_hub_loot_menu_98b914e3:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}好物不该白白糟蹋。"

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:23031
translate chinese silver_falcon_hub_loot_menu_76b2fe88_1:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:23037
translate chinese silver_falcon_hub_loot_menu_6d42a1ca:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你沿“银鹰客栈”的走廊前行，瞥见一间被洗劫一空的豪华客房——这里不久前还是某位富商与其年轻美伴下榻之所。"

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:23039
translate chinese silver_falcon_hub_loot_menu_8120630f:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}房间被翻了个底朝天，不过显然还有几样东西，强盗们没能来得及拿走。"

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:23041
translate chinese silver_falcon_hub_loot_menu_1c1f53b5:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}所幸还有你在后面兜底。"

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:23044
translate chinese silver_falcon_hub_loot_menu_76b2fe88_2:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:23050
translate chinese silver_falcon_hub_loot_menu_9e53d0b3:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你沿“银鹰客栈”的走廊前行，朝富商宾客所住的厢房走去。"

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:23052
translate chinese silver_falcon_hub_loot_menu_96242d35:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}等那伙盘踞此处的强盗捞足了油水、转去客栈别处搜寻后，你从他们停手的地方继续翻找。"

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:23054
translate chinese silver_falcon_hub_loot_menu_4c5f98fd:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你对袭击客栈的匪徒毫无好感。"

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:23056
translate chinese silver_falcon_hub_loot_menu_bf6c5769:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}然而，不论情愿与否，在洗劫“银鹰客栈”这件事上，你与他们站到了同一边。"

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:23059
translate chinese silver_falcon_hub_loot_menu_76b2fe88_3:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:23065
translate chinese silver_falcon_hub_loot_menu_788186f9:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你顶着昨夜豪饮留下的阵阵嗡鸣，沿“银鹰客栈”的走廊走向酒窖。"

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:23067
translate chinese silver_falcon_hub_loot_menu_d4baf7a2:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}没错，强盗们尽可以把这里的金银搜刮一空——但真正的珍藏，你绝不打算让给他们。"

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:23070
translate chinese silver_falcon_hub_loot_menu_76b2fe88_4:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:23079
translate chinese silver_falcon_hub_loot_menu_b2787652:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你决定先去找队长，沿着走廊小心翼翼地向他的房间摸去。"

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:23081
translate chinese silver_falcon_hub_loot_menu_cef3d898:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}半路上又撞见一伙强盗，正在洗劫一间陈设华贵的客房……"

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:23083
translate chinese silver_falcon_hub_loot_menu_76b2fe88_6:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:23086
translate chinese silver_falcon_hub_loot_menu_3224f735:

    "{cps=50}但你成功地从他们眼皮底下溜了过去。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}敏捷、协调——判定成功！"

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:23088
translate chinese silver_falcon_hub_loot_menu_1f51804d:

    "{cps=50}你想悄无声息地溜过去，却没能如愿。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}敏捷、协调——判定失败！"

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:23089
translate chinese silver_falcon_hub_loot_menu_8baa0654:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}强盗们发现了你，叫嚷着一拥而上。"

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:23094
translate chinese silver_falcon_hub_loot_menu_76b2fe88_5:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:23100
translate chinese silver_falcon_look_for_de_rossi_2_d690863e:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}所幸，用不着费太多功夫找队长。"

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:23102
translate chinese silver_falcon_look_for_de_rossi_2_5d0b64fa:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}德·罗西就在他自己的房间里。{vspace=5}{w}你发现他躺在血泊之中，眼窝里扎着一柄匕首。"

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:23104
translate chinese silver_falcon_look_for_de_rossi_2_8d3c72b5:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}再逗留下去已毫无意义，你决定离开“银鹰客栈”，尽快返回特雷维索。"

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:23106
translate chinese silver_falcon_look_for_de_rossi_2_76b2fe88:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:23112
translate chinese silver_falcon_look_for_de_rossi_2_7894d709:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你找到安娜的房间，但里面空无一人。"

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:23114
translate chinese silver_falcon_look_for_de_rossi_2_a1cc3f22:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}所幸，也找不到血迹或搏斗的痕迹。"

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:23116
translate chinese silver_falcon_look_for_de_rossi_2_76b2fe88_1:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:23121
translate chinese silver_falcon_look_for_de_rossi_2_76b2fe88_3:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:23123
translate chinese silver_falcon_look_for_de_rossi_2_50b35a8d:

    "{cps=50}抛下一切、即刻逃命的念头诱惑极大。"

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:23124
translate chinese silver_falcon_look_for_de_rossi_2_f30a55a7:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}然而，在德·罗西生死未卜之前，离开“银鹰客栈”无异于临阵脱逃。"

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:23126
translate chinese silver_falcon_look_for_de_rossi_2_76b2fe88_2:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:23129
translate chinese silver_falcon_look_for_de_rossi_2_91103b43:

    "{cps=50}你来到门厅，发现“银鹰客栈”的正门被一大群强盗把守——他们一面搜捕逃客，一面把赃物装进院子里停着的几辆大车。"

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:23134
translate chinese silver_falcon_look_for_de_rossi_2_76b2fe88_4:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:23138
translate chinese silver_falcon_look_for_de_rossi_2_76b2fe88_5:

    nvl clear
    ""

