# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:26193
translate chinese cannaregio_event_cat_9ecbcb42:

    "{cps=50}一条幽暗的小巷里，有只身形硕大的赤褐色公猫正盯着你。"

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:26194
translate chinese cannaregio_event_cat_610f9f94:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你本打算径直走过，可邻家门前卖枯草的老妇出声告诫：这只猫的目光，若有人敢无视，必将招来厄运。"

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:26198
translate chinese cannaregio_event_cat_bc570de8:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你走近那只猫，轻轻抚弄它的皮毛。"

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:26200
translate chinese cannaregio_event_cat_f4447cea:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}猫满意地眯起眼睛，随后隐入小巷的黑暗之中。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}虔诚提升1点！"

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:26203
translate chinese cannaregio_event_cat_c8f9efdd:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}待你回头再看，那老妇也已不见踪影。"

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:26209
translate chinese cannaregio_event_cat_e259bd6e:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}而你的钱袋则轻了不少——少了两捧硬币。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}失去[storyroll]弗罗林！"

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:26213
translate chinese cannaregio_event_cat_f2d3c3ca:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你礼貌地朝猫点了点头，从它身旁走了过去。"

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:26216
translate chinese cannaregio_event_cat_518fce3d:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你朝猫“嘘”了一声，把它赶走。猫不满地嘶嘶叫着，钻回阴影里不见了。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}虔诚-1！"

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:26220
translate chinese cannaregio_event_cat_76b2fe88:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:26225
translate chinese cannaregio_event_letter_695c1fe7:

    "{cps=50}一阵风卷起一张叠得精致的纸条，迎面扑到你的脸上，纸条上带着名贵香水的味道。"

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:26226
translate chinese cannaregio_event_letter_8864a050:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}厚实的羊皮纸上，用优雅的斜体字写着一封情书，收信人是某位{i}Ф.К.。"

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:26228
translate chinese cannaregio_event_letter_9c80757f:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}信的落款只有两个字母：{i}Л.И.。"

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:26230
translate chinese cannaregio_event_letter_76b2fe88:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:26235
translate chinese cannaregio_event_dead_09626224:

    "{cps=50}运河浑浊的水中，你注意到一具身着华服的尸体。"

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:26238
translate chinese cannaregio_event_dead_99f718f2:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你把尸体从水中捞起，飞快地搜遍了他的口袋。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}虔诚-5！"

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:26242
translate chinese cannaregio_event_dead_76b2fe88:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:26249
translate chinese cannaregio_event_dead_end_24c250f8:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}偏偏就在这时，一队城市巡逻卫兵从拐角转了出来，把你逮了个正着。"

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:26251
translate chinese cannaregio_event_dead_end_76b2fe88:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:26253
translate chinese cannaregio_event_dead_end_96d92b6f:

    "{cps=50}你总算证明了自己与这桩谋杀无关，但这件倒霉事还是耗去了你不少时间。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}时间损失：[storyroll!i]！"

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:26256
translate chinese cannaregio_event_dead_end_2a2e60eb:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你把发现的情况报告给了城市守卫。"

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:26258
translate chinese cannaregio_event_dead_end_362cd858:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你得以问心无愧，却也为此耗去了不少时间。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}虔诚+5！{vspace=5}时间损失：2！"

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:26263
translate chinese cannaregio_event_dead_end_1a3b812e:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你径直走了过去。"

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:26266
translate chinese cannaregio_event_dead_end_76b2fe88_1:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:26271
translate chinese cannaregio_event_bear_fe8083e1:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}路过一处小集市时，你撞见一个流浪艺人正追赶自己驯养的小熊崽。那小家伙挣脱了主人，在街上蹿得飞快，一路撞翻了好几个货摊。"

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:26275
translate chinese cannaregio_event_bear_868f9b9f:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你试着抓住小熊崽……"

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:26278
translate chinese cannaregio_event_bear_72851c26:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你还真逮住它了。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}敏捷、协调——成功！"

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:26282
translate chinese cannaregio_event_bear_07b9a38d:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你把这只毛茸茸的逃犯交还给它的主人，对方为表感谢，塞给你一把钱币。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}获得25弗罗林！"

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:26285
translate chinese cannaregio_event_bear_16cf9d60:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}但你失手了！{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}敏捷、协调——失败！"

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:26287
translate chinese cannaregio_event_bear_8b269495:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}小熊崽一口咬在你笨拙伸出的手上，随即敏捷地蹿进最近的拐角，不见了踪影。"

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:26290
translate chinese cannaregio_event_bear_b67ef12c:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}{color=#A9A9A9}流血！"

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:26294
translate chinese cannaregio_event_bear_0fc081e0:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}{color=#A9A9A9}生命值-1！"

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:26298
translate chinese cannaregio_event_bear_734367cb:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你选择不插手眼前这一切。"

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:26301
translate chinese cannaregio_event_bear_eee763d7:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}为帮小熊崽脱身，你悄悄伸脚绊了艺人一下。他一个踉跄摔在街面的石头上，磕得满脸是血。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}虔诚-5！"

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:26304
translate chinese cannaregio_event_bear_9df9b637:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}可惜这份得手的喜悦没能持续多久——几秒钟后，新犹太区的一个居民用弩箭射倒了小熊崽。"

