translate chinese venice_arsenal_visit_20ec7f11:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你来到威尼斯军械库……"

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:26437
translate chinese venice_arsenal_visit_76b2fe88:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:26440
translate chinese venice_arsenal_visit_f3e6624c:

    "{cps=50}你向军械库的主管说明形势之严峻，并表示自己急需大量新兵。"

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:26441
translate chinese venice_arsenal_visit_52d195b3:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}军械库主管答应尽力而为，但也坦言，眼下志愿兵的数量和训练的速度都有些跟不上。"

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:26443
translate chinese venice_arsenal_visit_1a51effc:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}他说，若能招来善于鼓动的说客和干练的教官，局面就有望改观。"

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:26445
translate chinese venice_arsenal_visit_80052cac:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你听出他的弦外之音，答应会想办法。"

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:26447
translate chinese venice_arsenal_visit_7d22f5d0:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}{color=#A9A9A9}获得新任务——[recruiting.name!ti]。"

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:26454
translate chinese venice_arsenal_visit_menu_76b2fe88:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:26466
translate chinese venice_arsenal_visit_menu_3b7b5f5f:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}威尼斯舰队总司令维托里奥·皮萨尼海军上将告知你，他计划在遥远的战区——黑海与地中海——对热那亚的堡垒和殖民地发动一连串袭击。"

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:26468
translate chinese venice_arsenal_visit_menu_0b0fff9d:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}据他估计，这些袭击恐怕难以左右战争的走向，但足以分散热那亚人的注意力，还能以缴获的战利品充实威尼斯国库。"

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:26470
translate chinese venice_arsenal_visit_menu_8821d712:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}皮萨尼海军上将还指出，威尼斯处处兵员吃紧，你若能率一队经验丰富的老兵参与他计划的某项行动，那是再好不过。"

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:26472
translate chinese venice_arsenal_visit_menu_76b2fe88_1:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:26481
