# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:31207
translate chinese della_torre_help_menu_3a8bdb1e:

    "{cps=50}交谈之中，德拉托雷家族成员几次三番用话头探你，想掂量你对贝尔纳博·维斯孔蒂的忠心……"

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:31211
translate chinese della_torre_help_menu_76b2fe88_6:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:31216
translate chinese della_torre_help_menu_309f2912:

    "{cps=50}然而[storyroll!ti]你斩钉截铁地表明自己忠于贝尔纳博。"

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:31219
translate chinese della_torre_help_menu_12bd4280:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你顺了他们的意，对贝尔纳博大加不满，并认同米兰确实该换个新主。"

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:31221
translate chinese della_torre_help_menu_c57574f0:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}德拉托雷家族族长赞许地拍了拍你的肩膀，许诺为你安排与詹加莱亚佐·维斯孔蒂见面——他持着同样的看法。"

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:31224
translate chinese della_torre_help_menu_76b2fe88_7:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:31230
translate chinese della_torre_help_menu_f0f0ae21:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}经德拉托雷家族安排，你与詹加莱亚佐·维斯孔蒂在一处隐秘之地相会——远离米兰，令贝尔纳博的密探与爪牙无从窥知。"

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:31232
translate chinese della_torre_help_menu_16cbded6:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}詹加莱亚佐说话开门见山。他说米兰的子民已受够了当权者的专横乖戾，又为其暴政流尽了血，随即向你透露了推翻他的计划。"

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:31234
translate chinese della_torre_help_menu_5a83bd06:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你本以为他会开口求助，却不料詹加莱亚佐仍端着客气的口吻、和蔼的举止，向你开出的却是一道最后通牒。"

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:31236
translate chinese della_torre_help_menu_51369c2e:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}要么你襄助推翻贝尔纳博，借此洗清自己与这位暴君、恶吏同流合污的罪愆，米兰新政权自当以“善意的中立”相报……"

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:31238
translate chinese della_torre_help_menu_89baa6f5:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}要么密谋者自行了断。可真到那一步，新政权恐怕就要重新掂量米兰的外交取向……"

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:31240
translate chinese della_torre_help_menu_f9ff2f76:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}昨日的敌人，一夜之间或成盟友。"

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:31242
translate chinese della_torre_help_menu_837bb8e9:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}而盟友，亦或成仇敌。"

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:31244
translate chinese della_torre_help_menu_f7f550a3:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}临别之际，詹加莱亚佐还劝你切莫以身试贝尔纳博的猜忌多疑，别把这番谈话说与他听。"

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:31246
translate chinese della_torre_help_menu_9335b182:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}{color=#A9A9A9}获得新任务——[death_of_tyrant.name!ti]"

