translate chinese della_torre_help_menu_76b2fe88_8:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:31257
translate chinese della_torre_help_menu_dc00697d:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}{color=#A9A9A9}威尼斯军队兵力减少[death_of_tyrant.timed_out!i]名士兵！"

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:31263
translate chinese della_torre_help_menu_5056a00d:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}为履行与詹加莱亚佐的密约，你再次借德拉托雷家族之口与他联络，调拨1000名威尼斯军队的士兵归他使用。"

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:31265
translate chinese della_torre_help_menu_cbe78026:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}因你的襄助，推翻贝尔纳博·维斯孔蒂的计划迅即付诸实施——詹加莱亚佐略施小计，将他的这位亲戚引出藏身之处，一举拿下，连同他所有有权有势的党羽。"

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:31267
translate chinese della_torre_help_menu_4e582c2d:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}翌日清晨，米兰已在新的掌权者治下。"

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:31269
translate chinese della_torre_help_menu_42a04271:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}詹加莱亚佐废黜了贝尔纳博所有荒唐的敕令，顷刻间赢得民心，也为自己的权柄打下了牢固根基。"

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:31271
translate chinese della_torre_help_menu_d784342e:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}至于外交，他也信守着与你的密约，在威尼斯与联盟的战争中，米兰选择了中立。"

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:31273
translate chinese della_torre_help_menu_76b2fe88_9:

    nvl clear
    ""

