translate chinese enter_the_schwarzburg_give_items_0e903fb7:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}离开卡尔的居所时，你收到一个意外的提议。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}威望——成功（[attackchance]）！"

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:31940
translate chinese enter_the_schwarzburg_give_items_8d3348d0:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}一位低级宫廷官员得知你觐见皇帝的来意后，建议你去拜访贡特尔·冯·施瓦茨堡伯爵的城堡。"

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:31942
translate chinese enter_the_schwarzburg_give_items_5fb6b312:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}据这位官员说，冯·施瓦茨堡伯爵聪慧机敏，能够帮你寻得所觅之物。"

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:31946
translate chinese enter_the_schwarzburg_give_items_8f8f090e:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你觉得这提议颇有意思，便应允下来，接过官员写给伯爵的推荐信，动身前往他的城堡。"

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:31948
translate chinese enter_the_schwarzburg_give_items_76b2fe88_32:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:31952
