translate chinese barnabo_feud_end_14bb29f5:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}贝尔纳博交托的指令，是要你铲除德拉·托雷家族。"

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:34135
translate chinese barnabo_feud_end_60482ff9:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}家族成员向你苦苦求饶——他们指天发誓自己清白无辜，自称是贝尔纳博·维斯孔蒂偏执与嗜血的牺牲品。"

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:34139
translate chinese barnabo_feud_end_b2ff8271:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你严格执行贝尔纳博·维斯孔蒂的指令，残忍地处决了宅中的每一个人。"

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:34144
translate chinese barnabo_feud_end_2bb8972d:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}{color=#A9A9A9}虔诚降低 [storyroll] 点！"

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:34146
translate chinese barnabo_feud_end_7a17568c:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}剿灭德拉·托雷家族之后，你向贝尔纳博·维斯孔蒂复命，禀报差事已经办妥。"

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:34149
translate chinese barnabo_feud_end_ed6efa1c:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你不愿以虐杀已经战败之人及其无辜家眷来玷污自己的名声，于是选择将德拉·托雷家族幸存者流放出去。"

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:34154
translate chinese barnabo_feud_end_6e93aae1:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}{color=#A9A9A9}虔诚增加 [storyroll] 点！"

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:34156
translate chinese barnabo_feud_end_2bce9d83:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}为答谢你的宽赦之恩，德拉·托雷家族的家主将一件家族圣物赠送于你，并说今后你随时可以倚仗他的援手。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}获得物品——[della_torre_warhammer.name!ti]。"

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:34160
translate chinese barnabo_feud_end_ad81baba:

