# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:39204
translate chinese giovanna_painting_1_postfight_cee1d263:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}收拾完这帮歹徒，你仔细搜查了这座宅邸——虽然已经半空，它仍残留着昔日奢华的痕迹：雕花家具、壁上巨大的织锦挂毯、精巧的烛台与枝形吊灯。"

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:39206
translate chinese giovanna_painting_1_postfight_9dbf6205:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}一楼的一间屋子里堆放着大量打点好的物件——看样子是准备启运，却还没来得及搬走。"

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:39208
translate chinese giovanna_painting_1_postfight_ede07145:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}其中还有几件包裹，从尺寸看像是画作。"

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:39210
translate chinese giovanna_painting_1_postfight_f195f370:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你拆开头一件，便寻得了要找的东西。"

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:39212
translate chinese giovanna_painting_1_postfight_76b2fe88:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:39223
translate chinese giovanna_painting_1_postfight_deb6d45a:

    "{cps=50}诱惑是巨大的——这座宅邸里想必还藏着不少值钱的物件，值得好好搜刮一番。"

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:39224
translate chinese giovanna_painting_1_postfight_a3002354:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}然而你心里清楚，多耽搁一刻便多一分与歹徒再遇的风险，这笔买卖未必划算。"

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:39228
translate chinese giovanna_painting_1_postfight_7976a999:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你终究抵不住诱惑，决定在宅子里好好搜刮一番。"

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:39231
translate chinese giovanna_painting_1_postfight_76b2fe88_1:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:39237
translate chinese giovanna_painting_end_loot_aac6e699:

    "{cps=50}荷包塞满之后，你朝门口走去，却有一伙不知从何处冒出来的歹徒拦住了去路。"

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:39240
translate chinese giovanna_painting_end_loot_76b2fe88:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:39245
translate chinese giovanna_painting_end_loot_c11a1468:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你无意久留。出了宅邸——此刻你才明白，这里地处威尼斯潟湖中的一座小岛上——你寻到一条小船，划回了威尼斯。"

