# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:39827
translate chinese venice_doge_chapter_3_end_f9d692ea:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你收到消息：皇帝卡尔驾崩后在神圣罗马帝国爆发的内战，以贡特尔·冯·施瓦茨堡的胜利告终。"

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:39829
translate chinese venice_doge_chapter_3_end_1f8468d2:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}施瓦茨堡上台后立誓要清算的对象之一便是威尼斯人——他指认他们是刺杀皇帝卡尔的幕后主使。"

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:39831
translate chinese venice_doge_chapter_3_end_4020a082:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}{color=#A9A9A9}获得新任务——[fragile_alliance_hre.name!ti]。"

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:39834
translate chinese venice_doge_chapter_3_end_76b2fe88_6:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:39839
translate chinese venice_doge_chapter_3_end_59a7da40:

    "{cps=50}你收到了一则令人震惊的消息：在热那亚人的协助下，德拉·托雷家族幸存的成员与詹加莱亚佐·维斯孔蒂合谋，设计诱骗贝尔纳博·维斯孔蒂落入陷阱，将他杀害。"

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:39840
translate chinese venice_doge_chapter_3_end_9ce541f0:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}推翻贝尔纳博在米兰的统治之后，詹加莱亚佐为答谢热那亚助他除掉叔父，决定加入反威尼斯联盟。"

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:39842
translate chinese venice_doge_chapter_3_end_a851380e:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}{color=#A9A9A9}获得新任务——[fragile_alliance_milan.name!ti]。"

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:39848
translate chinese venice_doge_chapter_3_end_76b2fe88_7:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:39856
translate chinese venice_doge_chapter_3_end_beb0f018:

    "{cps=50}你收到消息：经过不懈的外交斡旋，热那亚终于说动米兰加入了反威尼斯联盟。"

# game/script_dlc_4.rpy:39857
translate chinese venice_doge_chapter_3_end_a851380e_1:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}{color=#A9A9A9}获得新任务——[fragile_alliance_milan.name!ti]。"

